                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="share-circle-icon">
                <a href="mailto:?subject=Survey+Results+on+Economic+Conditions&amp;body=https%3a%2f%2fwww.philadelphiafed.org%2fthe-economy%2fmonetary-policy%2f230113-survey-results-on-economic-conditions" target="_blank">
